WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.460
Four sections.

2
00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:04.810
In each one, two questions
sit side by side,

3
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.920
and you answer only one.

4
00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:10.820
Every question is worth
25 marks, in four parts:

5
00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.990
3, 4, 6 and 12.

6
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.610
Once you start writing, it
pays to stay with your choice.

7
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.870
Switching wastes time.

8
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.640
So how do you choose well,
and then score on every part?

9
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:27.410
In this mission, you'll climb a
staircase of four command words,

10
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.270
from Identify up to Evaluate.

11
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:34.460
Then you'll take apart a 12-mark answer
on whether Christians should always be

12
00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.960
pacifists.

13
00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.490
Your mission: find out how to
choose your questions well,

14
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.330
then score on every part.
